      "extract": "In this section, we fix our notations. We assume that $q\\in\\mathbb{C}^*$ satisfies $0<~|q|<1$. We define the $q$-Pochhammer symbol $(a;q)_n$. ::: defi For any $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}_{\\ge 0}$, $$(a;q)_n= \\begin{cases} 1,&\\qquad n=0,\\\\ (1-a)(1-aq)\\cdots (1-aq^{n-1}),&\\qquad n\\ge 1, \\end{cases}$$ and $$(a;q)_\\infty =\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(a;q)_n.$$ Moreover, $$(a_1,a_2,\\cdots ,a_m;q)_\\infty =(a_1;q)_\\infty (a_2;q)_\\infty\\cdots",
      "extractCut": true
